The two spreadsheets are the core dataset: one library/sample inventory and one virus-catalog table with host taxonomy, tissue, accessions, read fraction, coverage, and best BLASTx hit. I’m computing cross-table counts now so the report and questions are grounded in actual fields rather than article-level description.
